{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/logo.gif?t=1745399763\" />\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>dark turn-based strategy-survival RPG</strong> blending retro-futuristic <strong>urban fantasy</strong> with <strong>Slavic folklore</strong>. <strong>Customise</strong> your characters\u2019 gender, class, and race, and <strong>recruit NPC</strong> allies to <strong>explore</strong> the wastelands, <strong>rebuild</strong> your colony, and <strong>engage in tactical card-based combat</strong>. Featuring branching narratives, <strong>character progression</strong>, and co-op for 2 players, every choice shapes your <strong>survival</strong> and the fate of humanity in this <strong>story-rich roguelite</strong> adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/16-9_gif_low_res_Event.gif?t=1745399763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/a8aa2d20-122a-44db-8a40-53b3b4438815.png?t=1745399763\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive and Explore a Story-Rich Post-Apocalytic World.</strong> Uncover the secrets of Thea through <strong>rich storytelling</strong>, engaging <strong>quests</strong>, and diverse points of interest. <strong>Scavenge</strong> vital <strong>resources</strong> and face environmental challenges as you navigate a retro-futuristic wasteland shaped by <strong>Slavic folklore</strong> and mystical ruins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/16-9_gif_low_res_CooP_New.gif?t=1745399763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Develop Your Hero and Party.</strong> Lead as your main hero while assembling a diverse party of NPC allies, each with unique abilities and personalities. Build and customize your team through deck-building mechanics and character progression, tailoring strategies to overcome the wasteland\u2019s many threats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/640x350_gif_1.gif?t=1745399763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overcome Tactical Challenges.</strong> Use your <strong>card deck</strong> to navigate the perils of a shattered world, resolving both combat and non-combat encounters. Battle monstrous foes in tense, <strong>turn-based skirmishes</strong> or strike <strong>dark bargains</strong> with cunning Slavic demons. The <strong>tactical</strong> use of your deck is essential to outwit enemies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/Fight_LOW_640x360_1.gif?t=1745399763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebuild and Manage Your Colony.</strong> Ensure the survival of your base by recruiting new NPCs for your party, expanding your settlement, and navigating the politics of the town council. Balance growth with survival as you work to revive civilization in the ruins of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/16-9_gif_low_res_Town.gif?t=1745399763\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/659bbf0d-753b-460a-a505-d02d18ec84bc.png?t=1745399763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Hero Creation:</strong> Personalise your hero's appearance, choose their class, gender, and tailor their abilities to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Branching Story:</strong> Every choice changes the story and shapes your future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebuild &amp; Manage:</strong> Rebuild your colony and manage resources in a crumbling world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong>: Stand against the cruelty of the wastelands and enemies out to get you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore &amp; Gather:</strong> Scavenge the land for rare resources and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Card-Based Combat:</strong> Build your deck and fight with tactical, card-driven battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft &amp; Customise:</strong> Craft gear, items, and of course some yummy Slavic foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Mode:</strong> Team up with a friend for two-player chaos!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360890?t=1745399763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360890?t=1745399763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/6f50ebd465205be8de24aa772464b3238843e119/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745399763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/6f50ebd465205be8de24aa772464b3238843e119/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745399763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/extras/logo.gif?t=1745399763\" />\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>dark turn-based strategy-survival RPG</strong> blending retro-futuristic <strong>urban fantasy</strong> with <strong>Slavic folklore</strong>. <strong>Customise</strong> your characters\u2019 gender, class, and race, and <strong>recruit NPC</strong> allies to <strong>explore</strong> the wastelands, <strong>rebuild</strong> your colony, and <strong>engage in tactical card-based combat</strong>. Featuring branching narratives, <strong>character progression</strong>, and co-op for 2 players, every choice shapes your <strong>survival</strong> and the fate of humanity in this <strong>story-rich roguelite</strong> adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_parag