b00a3ff65ea14a90fd7c3d.600x338.jpg?t=1745399763"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/058afbd2c57e8fbeebf5efdc5c46f6d02273f01a/ss_058afbd2c57e8fbeebf5efdc5c46f6d02273f01a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745399763","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/058afbd2c57e8fbeebf5efdc5c46f6d02273f01a/ss_058afbd2c57e8fbeebf5efdc5c46f6d02273f01a.600x338.jpg?t=1745399763"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/6782c76038a08a81c6e28aca79a0f87c5476eb47/ss_6782c76038a08a81c6e28aca79a0f87c5476eb47.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745399763","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360890/6782c76038a08a81c6e28aca79a0f87c5476eb47/ss_6782c76038a08a81c6e28aca79a0f87c5476eb47.600x338.jpg?t=1745399763"}],"short_description":"Wake to a brutal world bent on destroying your colony. Rebuild, Explore the Wastelands, and Gather scarce resources. Will you strike a deal with the ruthless Baba Yaga - or hack a rogue Cyber-Rat to turn it into an ally? A dark strategy-survival RPG with card-based tactical combat.","steam_appid":3360890,"support_info":{"email":"bugs@muhagames.com","url":"www.muhagames.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}